   - \( n = 2 \) (2 electrons are transferred)
   - \( F = 96480 \, \text{C mol}^{-1} \)
   - \( Q = \frac{[\text{Cu}^{2+}]}{[\text{Ag}^{2+}]} = \frac{0.2}{0.1} = 2 \)

   Substituting these values:
   \[
   E = 0.4576 \, \text{V} - \frac{(0.0821 \times 298 \times 2)}{96480 \times 2} \ln 2
   \]
