     \]
     where \( k_{RRRR} \) is the rate constant for the formation of the homochiral \( RRRR \) dimer, \( k_{RRSS} \) is the rate constant for the formation of the mixed \( RRSS \) dimer, and similarly for \( SSSS \) and \( SSRR \).

