   |f\rangle = U |i\rangle.
   \]

2. The unitarity condition for the \(S\)-matrix is:
   \[
   \sum_l S_{lm}^* S_{ln} = \delta_{mn}.
   \]

Substituting the definition of \(S\) into the unitarity condition:
\[
\sum_l (U^\dagger U)_{lm}^* (U^\dagger U)_{ln} = \delta_{mn}.
\]
Simplifying the expression:
\[
\sum_l (U^\dagger U)_{lm}^* (U^\dagger U)_{nl} = \delta_{mn}.
\]
